{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111153","id":2881256718,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rvH0O","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111153","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111153.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111153.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111153","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111153/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111153/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111153/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/268a47f1ca937fe564c1f51e862f7fc357274048","number":111153,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Speed up `GDScript::get_script_property_list` by not using an intermediate Vector","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The code would reverse the original sorted vector, just to reverse it again into an intermediate vector using `push_front`. Now it uses `push_back` and the sorted vector directly.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using these scripts</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\nclass_name PropA\r\n\r\nvar a1\r\nvar a2\r\nvar a3\r\nvar a4\r\nvar a5\r\nvar a6\r\nvar a7\r\nvar a8\r\nvar a9\r\nvar a10\r\n```\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends PropA\r\nclass_name PropB\r\n\r\nvar b1\r\nvar b2\r\nvar b3\r\nvar b4\r\nvar b5\r\nvar b6\r\nvar b7\r\nvar b8\r\nvar b9\r\nvar b10\r\n```\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tconst Props: Script = preload(\"b.gd\")\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tProps.get_script_property_list()\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"Took \" + str(t2 - t1) + \" usec\")\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nBenchmark (two separate runs, since some background task must have kicked in at some point):\r\n\r\n|                   | Before | After | %     |\r\n|-------------------|--------|-------|-------|\r\n| Run 1 (4 samples) | 77759  | 74832 | ~3.7% |\r\n| Run 2 (4 samples) | 78043  | 76048 | ~2.6% |\r\n\r\n> Note: While the speedup here is only around 3%, it's worth noting that this benchmark uses the GDScript version which also converts all results to `Dictionary`.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":351,"closed_issues":2337,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:17:38Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T10:14:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T16:45:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"98cb56773239c34feb98a2885d95350ef6c30c75","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HolonProduction:get-script-property-list-intermediate-list","ref":"get-script-property-list-intermediate-list","repo":{"id":546746307,"node_id":"R_kgDOIJavww","name":"godo